  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young voices for hope and solidarity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During this pilot project the Tamer and OD will pilot a project based on mutual exchange and development for the organisations and the youth volunteers involved. The focus will be on the strengthening of youth voices through the capacity building and development of alternative tools and platforms. With the increasing need to enhance more localised leadership, which can grow through mutual international partnerships, Danish and Palestinian volunteers, aged 15-25, will engage in two workcamps in Palestine, supporting a process in which they build capacities and produce outputs aimed at strengthening and expressing youth voice.  The pilot project is expected to develop and test a new format for continuous cooperation between the partners.</narrative>
  </description>
